WEBVTT

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.170
This is an opportunity.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.250
An opportunity...

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:30.500
This is a great opportunity to turn 
Burgundy into the most powerful empire.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.000
Montmorency...

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:51.320
<b>#11 Utopia, Then...</b>

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:04.560
Jeanne d'Arc and the Alchemist Knight

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.480
I hereby declare...

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:20.400
judgment has been passed!

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.040
She falsely assumed the title of a saint,

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.880
lied about her purity,

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:27.910
and the witch who conspired to throw 
France into darkness forever...

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.670
is no more!

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:01.530
Montmorency...

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:05.770
What's happening?

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:09.140
Hey, Jeanne! What happened to Montmorency?

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:10.700
Jeanne?

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.170
What?!

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.720
C-Could this be...

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.230
Jeanne!

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:38.080
I can't hear...

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:41.860
I can't hear Montmorency's voice anymore!

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.060
Montmorency!

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:49.640
Mur d'Air, was it?

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.880
Montmorency!

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:59.050
No, my name is Enlil.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.100
Ruler of the utopia,

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:04.130
and king among the seventy-two gods,

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.510
Enlil!

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:15.530
Montmorency... You're no longer...

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:18.950
Avenge him.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:20.790
Avenge him?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.560
Yes. Kill the god,

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.910
and spread your reputation 
as the god-killer...

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:30.460
as the black savior, Saint Philip,

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.210
throughout France and England.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:37.290
Use it as foundation of 
the rise of the Burgundy Empire!

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:40.190
Worry not.

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:43.550
You have a trump card by your hand.

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.690
I pulled you out of the river, along with this.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.630
Trump card.

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:02.090
What?

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.530
It's true that...

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:22.090
if that alchemist turned into Ulysses,

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:24.120
my arrow would be effective.

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.610
But have you forgotten?

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:29.400
He can block the arrow with a wall of air.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:33.100
Let's use Jeanne as a sacrifice, 
and create an opportunity for the shot.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.650
Oh?

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:38.550
This should be a good deal for you, 
as well as for Lord Bedford.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:41.110
Can I count on your assistance?

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:43.750
Can you do it?

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.420
Noire...

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:48.550
No, Princess Philip of Burgundy.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:52.400
I hear that you don't even 
kill a single insect.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.980
Your nickname is Philip the Good.

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:58.280
Can you do it?

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:03.060
This must be my destiny.

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:06.280
To avenge Montmorency.

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:11.170
That must be why I have 
crossed paths with this helm.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:15.390
In that case, I shall abandon 
my nickname and paint myself black.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.060
Can I count on your assistance?

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:30.660
Sure thing.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:34.790
Oh, no!

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.040
Pierce them!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.290
Protect your vital spot!

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:56.920
How long can we stay as Ulysses?

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:58.760
Not for long.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.710
I'll be your shield.

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:05.860
Destroy Montmorency's head!

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:10.240
Your hearts are linked, so you should 
know better than anyone else...

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.980
The one over there is no longer Montmorency.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:21.010
Make up your mind, Jeanne!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.000
Go, magical bullet!

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:36.390
Now, go!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.730
This is the end...

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.580
Come, my followers!

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:17.340
The time for judgment has come.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:30.500
It seems you have stayed 
in the Void Dimension for far too long.

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:34.190
Hey, this is not what we were expecting.

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:36.520
Is that thing still a Ulysses?

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:38.740
Will my arrow still work?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:44.140
The god did not try to kill Montmorency 
and grab his Philosopher's Stone.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.640
Why do you think that is?

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:49.690
As I thought, a special 
host is needed for us

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:53.610
to maintain our form and consciousness.

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:59.050
Oh, well. I shall just be the one 
and only god who obtained a host!

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:01.400
That is a Ulysses.

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.560
Get ready, Glasdale.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.770
Damn it!

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:10.070
I don't want to die a virgin!

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:11.040
What?!

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:14.220
I had my mind set on Etienne!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:17.140
I guess I'll just have to settle on you!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.730
The utopia will be restored!

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:25.070
The world will return 
to the way it should be.

00:09:25.070 --> 00:09:28.440
However, there will be 
no place in it for humans!

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:33.320
The next generation of slaves 
will not be made in our image.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:36.920
They will only obey our orders 
without thought or consciousness!

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.360
What a tragedy.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:43.820
Will this be the end of 
the history of human beings?

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:46.100
What are you...

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:51.120
I'm the one who turned humans against gods.

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:53.580
Punish me if you need to punish someone.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:57.240
You can burn me for eternity, 
or rip me apart for eternity.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.440
Do as you like.

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:01.690
So, please, spare them...

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:02.800
Spare the humansー

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:14.760
Stay there and witness 
the end of this false utopia.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:17.960
Not yet...

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:24.140
Respond to my voice, Ship in the Sky!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.380
What?!

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:39.480
Now!

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:47.420
<i>I dedicate this revenge to you, Montmorency.</i>

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.500
<i>I love you. I loved you!</i>

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.200
No way!

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:00.440
It's not over...

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:05.050
Montmorency is still here.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:08.380
I can tell.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.740
How long do you intend to hold onto me?

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:14.340
You're in my way!

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.070
Damn it!

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.820
Pathetic!

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.140
I couldn't tell.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:42.970
But you were able to feel his presence.

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:44.680
In that case...

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:48.810
you're the only one who can save Montmorency.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.980
Enough of your meaningless tussle!

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.240
Montmorency!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.680
Where am I?

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:25.860
Hello? Excuse me?

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.680
Where's Montmorency?

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:29.950
Huh?

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:32.130
Uh, um...

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:35.520
Oh, the grandson of Jean the Redbeard?

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:37.190
He's over there.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.500
Refinement of the Philosopher's Stone!

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.850
It'll become a true treasure!

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:00.960
The stone will give immortality to its owner!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.800
In other words, if I master alchemy...

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:14.550
If I master alchemy, I can stop 
people from dying in the war!

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:17.650
Is that your reaction?

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.300
You already told me at least a hundred times.

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:26.830
So you'll buy all the grimoire you can find...

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:28.090
Yeah!

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:30.730
I've been reading them, but it's like a code!

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:32.640
I'll have to become 
that old dude's apprentice.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:33.960
Montmorency!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.120
I'm so relieved!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:38.150
There you are!

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:42.990
Who are you?

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:45.340
It's me, Jeanne!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:49.160
Hey, only students are allowed 
on the school premises.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.600
Leave right now.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:52.850
Stop acting dumb, Montmorency!

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:54.280
Let go of me.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.000
I don't know you.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:59.730
So let go of me!

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.420
I get it now.

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:19.000
Montmorency is stuck in his past.

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:21.500
Hey, why don't we swear an oath?

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:24.310
To stay friends forever.

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:28.760
Let's do it, then!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:29.760
We will...

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.010
We will...

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:33.430
...even after we graduate from school...

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.940
...remain best friends forever!

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.460
Montmorency.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.750
You again?

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:44.940
Hey, Montmorency...

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:46.970
Don't speak to me like you know me.

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:49.930
I already told you that I don't know you.

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.260
The Philosopher's Stone.

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:55.480
You gave me half of it.

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:58.430
You saved me when I was about to die.

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:00.960
Many things have happened since.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.580
I went to the castle in Chinon, 
and they made me a knight.

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:07.720
We fought the English army at Orléans.

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:10.300
After my heart was pierced, you...

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.210
Stop it.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:15.720
You told me that you'll keep protecting me.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.850
That you'll never get married.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:20.920
Just as legendary knights swore 
their allegiance to noblewomen,

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:21.080
Stop!

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.360
as they have maintained their inner purity.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:27.600
Stop it!

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:36.580
Where am I now?

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.880
What are these?

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.790
My little sisters are sleeping in there.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:47.540
The girls who were taken to the castle...

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:51.080
and died in the tower.

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:55.480
They wanted to go home, to see their family.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:58.660
They all cried, lost all hope, and died.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.770
I couldn't save a single 
one of my little sisters.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:04.240
It's not your fault!

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:06.080
Jean the Redbeard did all this...

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:08.040
The old man has gone mad.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:10.680
But it's the war that made him that way.

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.880
Only the strong can survive.

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:19.240
You have to step over someone, 
or someone will step over you.

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:24.260
In a world like that, people have no 
choice but to be like Jean the Redbeard.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:29.160
Even if he died, nothing will change.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:33.960
Unless this war can be ended, 
the tragedies will never end.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:39.310
Alchemy...

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:42.500
If I master this, people won't die in wars.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:47.060
No, I can even end wars.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.650
Montmorency.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.650
Let's go home together.

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:56.870
Let's end the tragedies together.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.020
I'm sure we can do it.

00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:00.740
We can do it together.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:04.870
We can't be together.

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.010
What?

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:28.330
My ribbon?

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:33.160
I've seen...

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:34.940
what will happen to you.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:37.820
What will happen to me?

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:43.940
No way!

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:47.910
I saw the flow of time 
when I became one with Enlil.

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:50.270
I learned of things 
that happened in the past,

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.680
and things that will happen in the future.

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:55.660
Can't you feel it?

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:57.580
This is not an illusion.

00:17:58.020 --> 00:18:00.550
It's something unavoidable 
that will happen in the future.

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:05.370
But it's all right, as long as we stay here.

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:14.040
Brings back memories.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:17.390
Yeah, we were here not too long ago,

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:19.540
but it feels like decades ago.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:24.820
This must be a fake world.

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:27.370
But there's eternity in here.

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:29.510
Let's settle down here.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:32.390
Forget about the world.

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:38.090
As long as I have you, that's all I need.

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:50.020
We can't, Montmorency.

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:54.630
There are many sad things in the world.

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:58.460
War, betrayal, misunderstandings.

00:18:58.460 --> 00:19:01.360
But I love that world.

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:05.660
Princess Charlotte, La Hire, 
Astaroth, Richemont,

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:09.160
Alençon, Batard, Xaintrailles,

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:13.010
The Maiden Volunteer Corps, 
the villagers, and the fairies...

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:15.580
I love the world where they live.

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:17.530
You must feel the same way.

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:19.820
That's why you learned alchemy,

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.630
to make the world a better place.

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:24.560
But you won't be there!

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.620
We can't be together!

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:36.250
No, in the world where not 
only the strong can survive...

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:40.270
A world where people can survive 
without stepping over others...

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:43.240
In the world where you and I will create...

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:45.130
I will continue to live on.

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:49.080
I will be in everybody's smile.

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:53.050
So we'll always be together, Montmorency.

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:59.370
You idiot, you're talking like a real saint.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:07.720
I left you all alone for a while.

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:11.450
But from now on, we'll always be together.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:13.700
Let's go home.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.170
To our world.

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:19.780
Yeah, to our world.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:37.060
Get out of my body!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.650
I-Impossible...

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:47.300
This can't be happening!

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:54.620
D-Damn you!

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.230
Ship in the Sky!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:02.090
F-False utopia...

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:04.170
A world without gods...

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:06.860
cannot be allowed to exist!

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:15.960
We've been chosen.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:19.090
Not by the gods, and not by destiny.

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:22.510
You've chosen me, and I've chosen you!

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:26.340
It must be something 
that can't be achieved alone.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:28.430
It's meant to be achieved together.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:32.630
Our eternity exists in the 
world that we will change!

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.640
I-Impossible!

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:43.790
Your time is over.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:47.030
We'll create this world with our own hands!

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:50.030
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>#12 In This Wonderful World</b>

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:23.760
We will continue walking 
in the world without gods.

00:23:23.760 --> 00:23:25.710
Our footprints will probably 
eventually disappear,

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.580
but our feelings will never disappear!

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:30.380
It'll become history 
and continue for all eternity!

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:32.910
Final episode: In This Wonderful World.

00:23:32.910 --> 00:23:35.010
Boobs forever!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:37.010
<b>Surprisingly useful French lesson</b>

00:23:35.740 --> 00:23:41.010
<b>Protect the family jewels!</b>

00:23:35.740 --> 00:23:41.010
<b>Use it when someone is getting too close!</b>
